  description: Two small spirits on one glowing thread, one pale, one dark. They
    never fire together - the second waits for your answer to the first.
  tactics: Fires TWO red homing bolts in quick succession. The first pulls you, the
    second punishes the pull - keep moving through both instead of stopping after
    one. It weaves, so lead your shots.
